    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I just got the final report back from the audit on the Miller Group account. Honestly, it’s looking really good—their defenses are solid and they didn't have much trouble passing the tests.\n\nI'm a bit worried though, because I'm supposed to be pushing them toward that 'Advanced Continuous Monitoring' upgrade this quarter, and if I tell them they're already basically bulletproof, they're definitely gonna pass on the extra spend. \n\nHow should we frame these results to them so they see the value in signing the new contract?",
